        ],
        "text": "(Pandiyan walks with her.)",
        "notes": [
          "The corrected source prints this carry-over action at the beginning of scene 39. The historical English layer had incorrectly placed it at the end of scene 38."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s039-u001",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 50,
            "printedPage": 42
          }
        ],
        "text": "(Mill-strike posters have been pasted on walls throughout the town.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s039-u002",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 50,
            "printedPage": 42
          }
        ],
        "text": "(Inside the mill owner's room.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s039-u003",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 50,
            "printedPage": 42
          }
        ],
        "text": "(Paranthaman and Garudan arrive.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s039-u004",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "முதலாளி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s039-d001",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 50,
            "printedPage": 42
          }
        ],
        "text": "Come....sit down!....",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s039-u005",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 50,
            "printedPage": 42
          }
        ],
        "text": "(The two remain standing.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s039-u006",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s039-d002",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 51,
            "printedPage": 43
          }
        ],
        "text": "Why did you call us?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s039-u007",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 51,
            "printedPage": 43
          }
        ],
        "text": "(The two sit down.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s039-u008",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "முதலாளி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s039-d003",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 51,
            "printedPage": 43
          }
        ],
        "text": "Hmm...about this strike....",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s039-u009",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s039-d004",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 51,
            "printedPage": 43
          }
        ],
        "text": "It is all my arrangement—thousands of workers are ready to follow the path I showed them.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s039-u010",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "முதலாளி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s039-d005",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 51,
            "printedPage": 43
          }
        ],
        "text": "Mr Paranthaman! I know that only you can stop the mill workers' agitation.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s039-u011",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s039-d006",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 51,
            "printedPage": 43
          }
        ],
        "text": "Any doubt about that! If not for Paranthaman, by now they would have destroyed the mill itself!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s039-u012",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s039-d007",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 51,
            "printedPage": 43
          }
        ],
        "text": "And they were even about to endanger your life! I was the one who stopped them!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s039-u013",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "முதலாளி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s039-d008",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 51,
            "printedPage": 43
          }
        ],
        "text": "I'm pleased! Many thanks for saving my life! As a small token of help from me, I offer you these five thousand rupees.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s039-u014",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s039-d009",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 51,
            "printedPage": 43
          }
        ],
        "text": "What...money?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s039-u015",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s039-d010",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 51,
            "printedPage": 43
          }
        ],
        "text": "Take it! We can add it to the workers' fund! After all, we were born only to labour for the poor!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s039-u016",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "முதலாளி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s039-d011",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 51,
            "printedPage": 43
          }
        ],
        "text": "I am not giving this thinking of it as a bribe.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s039-u017",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s039-d012",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 51,
            "printedPage": 43
          }
        ],
        "text": "And I am not accepting it thinking of it that way either.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s039-u018",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "முதலாளி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s039-d013",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 51,
            "printedPage": 43
          }
        ],
        "text": "If you can somehow stop this strike.....",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s039-u019",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s039-d014",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 51,
            "printedPage": 43
          }
        ],
        "text": "It can be stopped. But that is possible only if Punyakodi is won over!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s039-u020",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s039-d015",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 51,
            "printedPage": 43
          }
        ],
        "text": "Punyakodi....he'll ask for at least three thousand!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s039-u021",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "முதலாளி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s039-d016",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 52,
            "printedPage": 44
          }
        ],
        "text": "I'll give it! I'll give it right now.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s039-u022",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 52,
            "printedPage": 44
          }
        ],
        "text": "(He takes out the money and gives it.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s039-u023",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s039-d017",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 52,
            "printedPage": 44
          }
        ],
        "text": "For the sake of your good nature, and because I want our friendship to continue, I am giving up a major agitation.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s039-u024",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "முதலாளி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s039-d018",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 52,
            "printedPage": 44
          }
        ],
        "text": "Many thanks!",
        "notes": []
      }
    ]
  }
}
